{"type":"text","timestamp":1777734519679,"sessionID":"ses_216c60402ffe2JsfyY5wEgPCMY","part":{"id":"prt_de93bf8ff001JC1JP2wNF7BjV8","messageID":"msg_de93bf54b001cvFDZHGLm1Gezh","sessionID":"ses_216c60402ffe2JsfyY5wEgPCMY","type":"text","text":"Wait—let me verify sort3 cases. Our stack representation: top = last in Vec. a_top() = a[len-1], a_second() = a[len-2], a_third() = a[len-3]. Rotations: ra pops last, inserts at 0.\n\nLet's verify case (0,2,1): stack top→bot = 0, 2, 1. Vec order (index 0..2) = [1, 2, 0]. After rra: remove index 0, push at end → Vec = [2, 0, 1]. Top = 1, second = 0, third = 2. That's (1, 0, 2). Then sa swaps last two → Vec = [2, 1, 0]. Top=0, second=1, third=2. That's (0,1,2). ✓\n\nCase (1,2,0): top→bot = 1,2,0. Vec = [0,2,1]. rra → Vec = [2,1,0]. Top=0, second=1, third=2 → (0,1,2). ✓\n\nCase (2,0,1): top→bot = 2,0,1. Vec = [1,0,2]. ra → pop 2, insert at 0 → Vec = [2,1,0]. Top=0 ✓\n\nCase (2,1,0): top→bot = 2,1,0. Vec = [0,1,2]. sa swap last two → [0,2,1]. rra → remove 0, push → [2,1,0]. Top=0 ✓\n\nGood.","time":{"start":1777734514943,"end":1777734519678}}}
