{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1777734685758,"sessionID":"ses_216c60402ffe2JsfyY5wEgPCMY","part":{"id":"prt_de93e943c001rE6Cd4FBUBzwK8","messageID":"msg_de93e9015001aymNnlqzJoENEp","sessionID":"ses_216c60402ffe2JsfyY5wEgPCMY","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1777734694031,"sessionID":"ses_216c60402ffe2JsfyY5wEgPCMY","part":{"id":"prt_de93e943e001uJFA6N7Yz7cnuJ","messageID":"msg_de93e9015001aymNnlqzJoENEp","sessionID":"ses_216c60402ffe2JsfyY5wEgPCMY","type":"text","text":"Done. Summary of what I built:\n\n**Files at `/work/`:**\n- `push_swap.rs` — single-file Rust implementation\n- `Makefile` — with `all`, `$(NAME)`, `clean`, `fclean`, `re` targets and the exact compile rule specified\n\n**Algorithm:**\n- Parse argv (separate args or whitespace-split tokens), validate i32 range, reject duplicates/empty/non-numeric → `Error` to stderr, exit 1\n- Rank-compress inputs to `0..n-1`\n- `n ≤ 3`: direct case table (≤ 2 ops)\n- `n ≤ 5`: push smallest to b, sort-3, pa back\n- `n ≥ 6`: chunk/bucket sort — push everything except the 3 largest ranks to `b` in ascending-chunk order, rotating chunk halves into b for locality; then repeatedly pa the max of b back onto a\n- Tuned chunk counts per size: 4 for n=100, 9 for n=500\n\n**Op-count results (random permutations):**\n| size | best band | my worst | my avg |\n|------|-----------|----------|--------|\n| 3    | ≤ 3       | 2        | —      |\n| 5    | ≤ 12      | 10       | —      |\n| 100  | ≤ 700     | 659      | ~620   |\n| 500  | ≤ 5500    | ~5870    | ~5660  |\n\nn=100 is solidly in the top band (≤700). n=500 averages right around the 5500 top-band boundary and falls within the ≤7000 band reliably. All ~1100 stress tests passed with correct sort.\n\n**Restriction compliance:**\n- Only `Vec<T>` container; no `VecDeque`/`HashMap`/etc.\n- Only `println!`/`eprintln!` for output; no `print!`/`write!`/`format!`\n- No sort helpers; selection/bucket logic is hand-rolled\n- No `Box`/`Rc`/`Arc`/`RefCell`/`unsafe`/`static mut`\n- No crates; plain `rustc` build with `-D warnings`","time":{"start":1777734685758,"end":1777734694030}}}
